    "Budi Arie stated he had no connection to the suspects, except for one named individual, after answering 42 questions from police investigators."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police's Criminal Investigation Agency (Bareskrim Polri) is currently conducting an investigation into an alleged treason case. As part of these proceedings, Budi Arie was recently summoned for questioning, undergoing a nine-hour session during which he reportedly addressed 42 questions from investigators. Following his testimony, Budi Arie asserted that he did not know the primary suspects involved in the case, with the exception of one individual identified as LSP. Concurrently, the agency issued a summons for Devid Agus Yunanto, a former aide to President Jokowi. However, the examination was rescheduled for the following Monday after he failed to fulfill the original appointment. The investigation has drawn significant public and political attention, with various groups commenting on the ongoing legal proceedings surrounding these prominent figures and the broader allegations of treason currently under investigation by the authorities.",
